   {
    "id": "tt_intro",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     0,
     680
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "## Totals and groups\n\nEvery table on the right is a **Show Table** fed from **Sales**. Click one and look at its Properties: **Total row**, **Total row at**, **Show as \u25b8 grouped**, **Group by**, **Subtotals** and **Totals in output**, plus the rules in **Conditional formatting**.\n\nPress **Rules\u2026** to see the same lines in the builder \u2014 the **Totals & groups** page, and **Text colour** / **Draw on** on the Highlight page.\n\nOpen the **Dashboard** and **Report** tabs to see the same tables on a page and on paper.",
     "width": 460,
     "height": 360
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_total",
    "type": "flograph.viz.show_table",
    "pos": [
     700,
     0
    ],
    "params": {
     "totals": "sum",
     "format_rules": "Revenue  format $,.0f\nProfit   format $,.0f\nRevenue  bar blue\nUnits    total average\nProduct  total distinct\nRegion   total \"All regions\"\nProfit < 0 => fg red\nProfit < 0 => fg red, icon \u25bc red right, on total\nProfit > 0 => fg green, on total",
     "width": 680,
     "height": 420
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": "1 \u00b7 A total row"
   },
   {
    "id": "tt_total_note",
    "type": "flograph.util.note",
    "pos": [
     1620,
     0
    ],
    "params": {
     "text": "**1 \u00b7 A total row.** *Total row \u25b8 sum* totals every number column. The rules box refines it a column at a time:\n\n- `Units total average` \u2014 one column averaged instead\n- `Product total distinct` \u2014 how many different products\n- `Region total \"All regions\"` \u2014 words instead of a number\n\nClick a header: the rows sort, the total stays at the bottom. The data bar ignores the total (it would always be the longest), and `on total` gives the total its own colour and \u25bc.",
     "width": 520,
     "height": 260
    },
    "code": null,
    "label": null
   },
