   {
    "id": "tt_report",
    "title": "Live Report",
    "kind": "report",
    "body": "# Sales review \u2014 Q1 to Q2\n\nFour regions, three products, two quarters. Embeds marked `|live` are live in\nthe **Web** preview and in **Save HTML**; the Pages preview and the PDF are\nunchanged. Try the CSS tab's starter themes \u2014 *Compact*, *Dashboard* and\n*Midnight* were made for this page.\n\n> **East** carried the half: the most revenue in both quarters, and the only\n> region with every product in profit in Q2. **South** sold volume at a loss.\n\n## Revenue by quarter\n\nHover a bar for its value, drag to zoom, double-click to reset, click a region\nin the legend to hide it.\n\n![[Revenue by quarter|live]]\n\n## Around the world\n\nA live map with no network: the country outlines ship with flograph and\ntravel inside the saved page. Hover a country, drag to pan, scroll to zoom.\n\n![[Revenue by Country|live]]\n\n## By region\n\nClick a region's row to fold it. Type *Gadget* or *West* in the box.\n\n![[3 \u00b7 Grouped by region|search]]\n\n### Region, then product\n\nThe outer level starts open and the products folded, as on the card.\n\n![[4 \u00b7 Nested, starts folded|live]]\n\n## Columns that fold\n\nClick a heading over the columns \u2014 **Revenue**, **Units** \u2014 to fold its\nquarters to one column, and again to open them. *Expand all* and *Collapse\nall* fold the rows and the columns together.\n\n![[8 \u00b7 Headings, and sparks on the groups|live]]\n\n### A matrix's own headings\n\n![[7 \u00b7 A matrix's own headings|live]]\n\n## Every sale\n\nClick a heading to sort. The box is 8 rows tall and scrolls \u2014 every row is\nthere, not the first 30. Hover a cell for its column.\n\n![[1 \u00b7 A total row|rows=8|search]]\n\n## Side by side\n\n```columns\n![[Units against profit|live]]\n---\n![[Revenue by quarter|live]]\n```\n\n## For comparison: not live\n\nThe same chart without `|live` \u2014 the PDF's picture, no hover.\n\n![[Revenue by quarter|width=60%]]\n\n- **Live** is opt-in, per embed: `|live`, or `|search` for a table.\n- A saved file carries Plotly only if a chart on it is live.\n- Printed from a browser, a live chart prints as its picture.\n",
    "preview_mode": "web"
   }
  ]
 }
}